Id: dns005f
Severity: FAIL
Category: network
Check: check_dns
Fix: Allow localhost and the local networks only.
References: unbound.conf(5)
Controls: CIS 4.8; NIST SC-5, SC-7; ISO 8.20; CE Firewalls

Unbound answers recursion to anyone: an access-control line allows
0.0.0.0/0 or ::/0. An open resolver serves the whole Internet,
including spoofed queries that turn it into an amplifier for
denial-of-service attacks against others.
